### Todo API: sample requests
### Works directly with the VS Code "REST Client" extension.
### For Postman: import this file via File > Import (Postman supports .http/.rest files),
### or recreate each request manually using the method/url/body below.

@baseUrl = http://localhost:5000/api/tasks

### 1. CREATE TASK (expect 201)
POST {{baseUrl}}
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "title": "Finish assignment",
  "description": "Build and test the Todo REST API",
  "dueDate": "2026-08-25"
}

### 1b. CREATE TASK - validation failure (expect 400 once errorHandler fix is applied)
POST {{baseUrl}}
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "description": "Missing the required title field"
}

### 2. GET ALL TASKS (expect 200)
GET {{baseUrl}}

### 2b. GET ALL TASKS - filtered (expect 200)
GET {{baseUrl}}?completed=false

### 3. GET ONE TASK (replace :id with a real _id from step 1's response) (expect 200)
GET {{baseUrl}}/REPLACE_WITH_TASK_ID

### 3b. GET ONE TASK - not found (expect 404)
GET {{baseUrl}}/000000000000000000000000

### 4. UPDATE TASK (expect 200)
PUT {{baseUrl}}/REPLACE_WITH_TASK_ID
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "isCompleted": true
}

### 5. DELETE TASK (expect 204)
DELETE {{baseUrl}}/REPLACE_WITH_TASK_ID